# Run H2 (2026-11-06, user: "no noise pin"): run H (il_finetune_c0_sac_td3bc.env,
# SAC with the TD3+BC cloning term inside the actor loss, ACTOR_BC_ALPHA=2.5) with
# the actor's noise NOT pinned -- standard SAC learns its own log-std (entropy
# term, auto-tuned temperature). Everything else as run H: c0 step 15000,
# il_data + il_data_cover, LayerNorm critic, frozen trunk, 1000 critic-only
# online updates. Watch the actor's log-std: in every earlier unpinned clone
# fine-tune the steering noise grew (run D: -3.70 -> -1.99 by ~500 actor updates).
. "$REPO/slurm/il_finetune_c0_sac_td3bc.env"
unset ACTOR_LOG_STD
